WEBVTT

00:01.466 --> 00:03.801
So that Hazamada guy really said

00:03.885 --> 00:06.304
he knows zilch about the
the super-charged sonuvabitch

00:06.429 --> 00:08.722
who killed my bro?

00:08.973 --> 00:09.723
Yeah.

00:09.891 --> 00:12.393
He said he's only ever
talked to him over the phone.

00:12.685 --> 00:17.106
And you believed him, Josuke?
You tortured the bastard, right?

00:17.232 --> 00:19.984
Look, if Hazamada really
knew who the user is,

00:20.485 --> 00:23.112
he would've been
totally snuffed out by now.

00:24.489 --> 00:26.324
I guess you're right…

00:26.491 --> 00:28.743
Just like my bro.

00:29.369 --> 00:30.203
Yeah.

00:30.537 --> 00:35.037
That Hazamada's still breathing
is proof enough he's telling the truth.

00:35.583 --> 00:38.794
But Hazamada also had this to say…

00:39.963 --> 00:44.463
<i>For whatever reason, whether
or not they know each other,</i>

00:45.426 --> 00:47.928
<i>Stand users are inadvertently
drawn to each other.</i>

00:48.137 --> 00:51.390
<i>You know the myth that
says the red thread of fate</i>

00:51.474 --> 00:53.476
<i>connects you with
your partner-to-be, right?</i>

00:53.768 --> 00:54.643
<i>Well, it's like that.</i>

00:55.019 --> 00:57.104
<i>Someday, in some place,
they'll cross paths.</i>

00:58.481 --> 01:00.274
<i>The user could be
an enemy, a friend,</i>

01:00.358 --> 01:03.277
<i>the guy stepping on your foot
on the bus,</i>

01:03.528 --> 01:06.155
<i>or your new next-door neighbor.</i>

01:06.281 --> 01:08.283
<i>Nobody knows.</i>

01:08.658 --> 01:10.493
<i>Morioh's a small town, you know…</i>

01:10.660 --> 01:13.996
<i>Who knows how many
Stand users it has.</i>

01:14.247 --> 01:18.084
<i>But try as they may to hide,
they'll eventually emerge.</i>

01:19.127 --> 01:22.505
<i>He knows it's inevitable.</i>

01:22.839 --> 01:25.883
<i>He wants you to disappear.</i>

01:27.468 --> 01:28.886
Dammit.

01:29.095 --> 01:30.471
He's a damn coward!

01:30.638 --> 01:32.681
What the hell is he waiting for?!

01:33.057 --> 01:36.101
It just means he's playing it safe.

01:36.436 --> 01:38.688
When guys like that decide to attack,

01:39.314 --> 01:42.400
it's because they
know there's no way they can lose.

01:42.900 --> 01:43.650
Oh?

01:46.821 --> 01:49.031
Hey, that's Koichi.

01:49.240 --> 01:51.909
What's he doing posing
in some snooty cafe?

01:52.493 --> 01:54.119
Hey, Ko—

01:54.245 --> 01:55.287
What?!

01:59.334 --> 02:01.836
A… A girl?!

02:17.518 --> 02:19.937
JOJO'S BIZARRE ADVENTURE
DIAMOND IS UNBREAKABLE

02:21.564 --> 02:24.900
<i>These faceless gazes pass by one another</i>

02:25.234 --> 02:28.570
<i>A wound to the heart changes our everyday</i>

02:28.780 --> 02:33.280
<i>Encounters without boundaries
The bizarre is our normal U-yeh</i>

02:35.745 --> 02:39.081
<i>These ordinary mornings,
we're laughing on the surface</i>

02:39.165 --> 02:42.793
<i>Mysteries drawn to each other,
identity still unknown</i>

02:42.877 --> 02:47.377
<i>Without a heads up,
it's quietly lurking somewhere in this town</i>

02:51.969 --> 02:56.469
<i>Although we bicker and complain
In the end, we celebrate</i>

02:59.018 --> 03:02.396
<i>Dancing through the everyday</i>

03:02.480 --> 03:06.980
<i>Crazy Noisy Bizarre Town</i>

03:18.037 --> 03:22.124
EPISODE 8
YUKAKO YAMAGISHI
FALLS IN LOVE, PART 1

03:18.496 --> 03:21.165
Koichi, I hope meeting me here…

03:21.708 --> 03:22.146
wasn't too much…

03:23.626 --> 03:24.668
of a nuisance.

03:24.752 --> 03:29.131
Huh? No, it wasn't a nuisance at all…

03:29.298 --> 03:31.550
I did kinda wonder
what this was all about.

03:31.926 --> 03:34.678
Wow, Koichi with a girl…

03:34.929 --> 03:38.182
That's Yukako Yamagishi
from my class.

03:38.307 --> 03:40.309
Come on! Let's get a closer look!

03:41.310 --> 03:43.770
If you want me to show you
my homework,

03:44.021 --> 03:46.106
I have to tell you my grades
aren't that good,

03:46.190 --> 03:47.608
and my handwriting's kinda messy.

03:47.942 --> 03:50.986
If it's money you need, I could
probably give you 'bout 1,000 yen…

03:51.279 --> 03:54.156
Or do you want me to
be the weekly class leader?

03:54.490 --> 03:55.991
No, I don't want any of those things.

03:56.284 --> 03:59.370
Huh? You don't?
Then what is it?

03:59.787 --> 04:02.039
If you need someone to take
in a kitten or a puppy,

04:02.290 --> 04:04.834
sorry to say I already
have a dopey dog named Police.

04:04.959 --> 04:05.793
Koichi!

04:06.961 --> 04:08.337
I have to tell you something.

04:10.131 --> 04:11.048
Koichi…

04:12.300 --> 04:13.050
I…

04:13.551 --> 04:14.969
Koichi, I love you!

04:15.344 --> 04:15.927
Huh?

04:16.012 --> 04:17.972
What'd she say?!

04:19.348 --> 04:23.018
U-Um… Uh, um…
Wh-What was that?!

04:23.144 --> 04:27.189
All day, you're all
I think about, Koichi.

04:28.149 --> 04:30.192
I've been so frightened
to utter those words to you…

04:31.068 --> 04:34.780
I couldn't hold it in anymore.
My heart was going to burst.

04:35.198 --> 04:36.949
I understand if you hate me.

04:37.575 --> 04:40.369
I had to take the leap and tell you.

04:42.622 --> 04:45.625
<i>Is this really happening?
Is she professing her love…</i>

04:45.833 --> 04:46.917
<i>to me?!</i>

04:47.543 --> 04:50.420
<i>I wouldn't believe it if I hadn't heard it.
That's what she said, right?</i>

04:53.007 --> 04:54.633
<i>I-I'm so happy…</i>

04:55.885 --> 04:57.386
Why Koichi?

04:57.512 --> 04:59.555
This can't be happening!
There's no way!

04:59.931 --> 05:02.475
No one's ever said that to me!

05:02.600 --> 05:04.852
Come on, there's no need to cry!

05:05.353 --> 05:08.939
But holy crap…
That Koichi is something…

05:09.732 --> 05:12.526
Koichi, you must have
a girlfriend already…

05:12.860 --> 05:14.862
Huh? No, actually I don't…

05:14.946 --> 05:18.491
But, well…
You wouldn't be teasing me would—

05:18.574 --> 05:20.158
I'm dead serious!

05:21.452 --> 05:25.330
Koichi, I noticed recently your face
has become more chiseled.

05:25.832 --> 05:28.918
A strong face with
courage and conviction…

05:29.293 --> 05:32.087
Then I see that smile…
And you become so charming.

05:32.380 --> 05:35.299
Hmm, I see what's she's saying.

05:35.466 --> 05:37.593
I have a chiseled face too, don't I?

05:37.885 --> 05:42.139
What attracts me most
to a man is his potential.

05:42.557 --> 05:44.767
And Koichi, you're brimming with it!

05:45.434 --> 05:47.894
Wow, no one's ever said that to me…

05:48.771 --> 05:52.149
But you must hate
homely girls like me, though.

05:52.775 --> 05:56.487
Huh? Homely? That's not it at all…

05:56.821 --> 05:58.906
Dammit, she's hot!

05:59.282 --> 06:00.741
Just go out with her already!

06:01.117 --> 06:03.619
That bastard has all the luck!

06:04.495 --> 06:06.830
Do you hate me?

06:09.500 --> 06:13.337
Huh?
Uh, no that's not it at all…

06:14.130 --> 06:15.005
Do you love me?

06:15.339 --> 06:19.301
Huh? Wait a sec…
It's just that, um…

06:20.052 --> 06:21.344
You do hate me…

06:21.429 --> 06:22.972
Huh? No, not at all!

06:23.097 --> 06:25.432
It's just, you caught me
off guard when you—

06:25.975 --> 06:29.728
Which is it?!
Do you love me or not?!

06:29.854 --> 06:32.857
Answer me, dammit!
I already poured my heart out to you!

06:33.608 --> 06:37.153
And now I spilled my coffee!
This is all because of you!

06:41.449 --> 06:45.828
I… I'm so sorry…
I don't know what came over me.

06:49.248 --> 06:52.167
Well, you will come
see me again, won't you?

06:55.379 --> 06:59.879
I… I suddenly feel
like a deflated balloon.

07:00.134 --> 07:03.095
That totally got rid of
any jealousy I had.

07:03.346 --> 07:04.013
Y-Yeah…

07:04.096 --> 07:06.056
Let's pretend we didn't see that.

07:07.058 --> 07:07.808
Yeah.

07:12.772 --> 07:14.273
What's with my cola?!

07:14.732 --> 07:18.694
What's all this hair in it?!

07:19.320 --> 07:22.031
Stand users are drawn to each other…

07:23.157 --> 07:24.366
It couldn't be…

07:28.704 --> 07:30.455
CHEMISTRY LAB

07:39.674 --> 07:41.050
It's me, Koichi.

07:43.594 --> 07:44.553
Y-Yukako!

07:45.554 --> 07:46.763
Whatcha doing?

07:46.973 --> 07:50.685
Um, well, as you can see,
it's my turn to clean the lab.

07:50.977 --> 07:53.354
Fourth period was chemistry lab.

07:53.604 --> 07:54.980
Ah…

07:56.857 --> 07:57.899
Koichi…

07:58.734 --> 08:01.528
I know I said
some strange things yesterday.

08:01.821 --> 08:03.823
You'll forget all that, won't you?

08:04.991 --> 08:08.828
I always get that way
when I overthink things.

08:09.412 --> 08:10.579
I'm so embarrassed.

08:10.705 --> 08:13.708
I suppose it's always
important to be open minded.

08:14.208 --> 08:16.168
Uh, r-right…

08:16.419 --> 08:20.919
You surprised me a little,
b-but I didn't think anything of it…

08:21.590 --> 08:24.676
We can still be friends, right?

08:24.760 --> 08:27.929
Yes, of course! I'd like that!

08:29.306 --> 08:31.099
Oh, thank goodness!

08:31.350 --> 08:33.602
I was so worried you hated me!

08:33.686 --> 08:35.396
I was tossing and turning all night.

08:36.647 --> 08:37.939
You were just overreacting.

08:38.190 --> 08:41.902
And as a little something
to show you I'm sorry… Here.

08:43.112 --> 08:47.157
I spent all night
knitting this for you, Koichi.

08:47.658 --> 08:50.077
I'm so relieved! It fits perfectly!

08:50.161 --> 08:53.747
I knew the length and chest width, but
I had know idea about the shoulders.

08:53.664 --> 08:56.124
CHARM

08:53.914 --> 08:55.165
I made you an amulet, too…

08:55.583 --> 08:56.146
Now you can find true love.

08:58.335 --> 09:02.835
I also made us a couple of bento boxes
so we can have lunch together…

09:05.342 --> 09:07.761
I bought this shrimp
this morning at the local market.

09:08.220 --> 09:10.847
You can't find this freshness
at a grocery store.

09:11.390 --> 09:12.682
And this is flounder meuniere.

09:12.767 --> 09:15.811
I made sure to remove
every single bone with tweezers.

09:16.312 --> 09:17.855
Now, say, "Ah."

09:18.230 --> 09:19.022
Ahh…

09:19.106 --> 09:20.816
<i>I know one thing's for sure…</i>

09:21.108 --> 09:25.445
<i>Yukako Yamagishi is
completely deranged!</i>

09:25.529 --> 09:26.780
Ahh…

09:26.906 --> 09:28.324
<i>I've gotta put a stop to this now!</i>

09:28.741 --> 09:31.827
<i>B-But if I take a bite,
I'll just validate her feelings…</i>

09:31.952 --> 09:33.745
<i>And if I refuse, she'll kill me!</i>

09:33.954 --> 09:36.289
<i>What am I gonna do?!</i>

09:36.791 --> 09:38.000
Hirose!

09:38.375 --> 09:40.043
Quit slacking off!

09:40.294 --> 09:43.630
Hurry up and dump
this garbage before class starts.

09:44.131 --> 09:45.882
<i>Thank god!</i>

09:46.300 --> 09:48.510
Of course! Of course!

09:48.803 --> 09:51.013
I better go throw it away.

09:52.181 --> 09:54.099
Ugh, you're hopeless.

09:54.266 --> 09:55.600
Here, give me that.

09:55.810 --> 09:56.977
I'll take the other side.

09:57.186 --> 09:59.730
Huh? N-No, you don't have to…

09:59.814 --> 10:01.690
Just hand it over!

10:02.108 --> 10:04.401
I'm the class rep, so I'll be
the one getting yelled at.

10:04.652 --> 10:06.987
- Jeez!
- S-Sorry…

10:18.124 --> 10:19.208
Hey, you.

10:20.459 --> 10:23.170
Would you mind
stop flirting with Koichi?

10:23.337 --> 10:26.715
Koichi? You mean Koichi Hirose?

10:27.174 --> 10:30.760
I don't have the foggiest idea
what you're talking about.

10:30.928 --> 10:32.220
I know exactly
what you're trying to pull.

10:32.471 --> 10:35.807
I can smell homewrecker
all over you!

10:36.100 --> 10:38.268
Home-what?!
What the hell are you talking about?

10:38.686 --> 10:39.561
Listen carefully.

10:39.979 --> 10:42.189
If I ever catch you trying
to seduce Koichi again,

10:42.606 --> 10:45.609
I'll make your perfect
little life a living hell.

10:48.362 --> 10:49.696
Not so fast, bitch.

10:49.822 --> 10:51.448
I was trying to take the high road.

10:51.699 --> 10:53.325
This is all about Koichi Hirose?

10:53.576 --> 10:55.995
I couldn't give two shits about him!

10:56.328 --> 11:00.582
You can't tell me
what I can or can't do!

11:00.666 --> 11:01.750
Dumbass!

11:02.668 --> 11:04.586
Ow!

11:06.130 --> 11:08.132
What was that?

11:10.217 --> 11:11.801
What the hell is her problem?!

11:11.969 --> 11:15.138
She's out of her mind.
She has the hots for Hirose?

11:15.389 --> 11:19.309
Hmph. Don't make me laugh.
The entire school'll hear about this!

11:20.019 --> 11:20.769
Huh?

11:22.062 --> 11:23.938
What is that?

11:25.900 --> 11:29.069
I feel something hot…
Something's not right.

11:29.403 --> 11:30.779
Something's really not right…

11:31.906 --> 11:33.908
This is crazy hot…

11:39.455 --> 11:41.123
W-Water!

11:44.710 --> 11:47.796
S-Someone! I need w-wa…

11:56.597 --> 11:58.140
Hey, Josuke…

11:59.016 --> 12:02.978
Looks like Yukako Yamagishi
really is a Stand user.

12:03.437 --> 12:05.730
A Stand that manipulates hair at will.

12:06.065 --> 12:07.066
Yeah.

12:07.358 --> 12:11.779
But it doesn't look like she'd attack
Koichi or us for that matter.

12:12.112 --> 12:16.407
So, Okuyasu, what are you
gonna do about her hair?

12:16.992 --> 12:21.492
I can't fix stuff the Hand takes away.

12:23.082 --> 12:24.583
I think I've done enough!

12:24.667 --> 12:26.669
I kept her from getting burnt
to a crisp, didn't I?

12:26.877 --> 12:30.046
Sorry to disappoint,
I'm not much of a stylist.

12:41.308 --> 12:44.019
REVERB
KOICHI HIROSE

12:44.478 --> 12:47.731
What am I gonna do?

12:47.273 --> 12:50.526
YEAR 1
ENGLISH EXAM ANSWER SHEET
QUIZ 2 KOICHI HIROSE

12:48.065 --> 12:50.484
Look what I got
on my latest English test.

12:51.735 --> 12:55.655
Yukako is stressing me
out so much, I can't concentrate.

12:55.864 --> 12:58.283
Even I did better!

12:58.492 --> 12:59.993
My score was only 32, though.

13:00.077 --> 13:04.577
You know, to be totally honest,
I was a little excited at first.

13:05.541 --> 13:08.919
No girl's ever said
she loved me before.

13:09.003 --> 13:13.503
I know. Believe me, I know!
All too well!

13:14.466 --> 13:18.261
I was too wishy-washy
and brought all this on myself!

13:18.429 --> 13:21.557
I'll do it!
That's what I'm gonna tell her!

13:21.765 --> 13:24.976
I'm not interested,
so leave me alone!

13:25.185 --> 13:27.187
I'd think twice about that, Koichi.

13:27.354 --> 13:31.854
You're only going to fan
the flames of Yukako's passion.

13:32.693 --> 13:33.944
She'll lose it again.

13:35.988 --> 13:36.822
I guess you're right.

13:37.031 --> 13:39.366
Of course I'm right.
Now listen.

13:39.575 --> 13:44.075
Convincing Yukako Yamagishi to stop
using her hair for evil can wait.

13:45.122 --> 13:47.582
Right now,
we've gotta figure out a way

13:47.791 --> 13:50.376
to not directly provoke her to anger.

13:50.502 --> 13:52.504
But how?

13:52.838 --> 13:55.674
Look, no matter how infatuated
she is with you,

13:56.008 --> 13:57.926
if she comes to
her own conclusion that

13:58.052 --> 14:01.346
you're the most pathetic, grossest,
schmuck around,

14:01.430 --> 14:03.056
then everyone lives
happily ever after, right?

14:03.223 --> 14:04.182
Y-Yeah…

14:04.308 --> 14:08.562
So all you've got to
do is act that way in front of her.

14:08.645 --> 14:11.147
I get it! That'll work!

14:11.231 --> 14:12.857
You're so smart, Josuke.

14:12.941 --> 14:14.108
Well thank you!

14:14.401 --> 14:16.861
Not sure how much of
a compliment it is coming from you.

14:16.945 --> 14:21.282
What could I do to make
Yukako think I'm totally unappealing?

14:21.450 --> 14:25.950
Well, mama's boys and gross guys
are usually major turn offs.

14:27.247 --> 14:28.957
I can't make her think
I'm a mama's boy!

14:29.083 --> 14:32.294
Then she'll hate my mom
and go after her!

14:32.461 --> 14:34.421
That settles it.
You'll be the gross guy!

14:34.546 --> 14:36.297
No more baths from now on.

14:36.382 --> 14:37.007
Huh?!

14:37.091 --> 14:40.677
Yeah, and no teeth brushing
or changing your underwear.

14:40.761 --> 14:43.472
How about raising some lice
or spiders in your hair?

14:43.597 --> 14:45.849
Yeah but stinky socks are pretty gross.

14:45.933 --> 14:48.101
Just fart all over the place.

14:48.185 --> 14:49.394
She'll think you're foul!

14:49.603 --> 14:52.772
This isn't a joke! I'm serious!

14:52.898 --> 14:54.774
I am being serious!

14:54.983 --> 14:56.859
You gotta have snot and drool, too!

14:57.152 --> 14:58.444
What?!

14:59.279 --> 15:02.782
If you don't like that,
then it looks like your only option is to

15:02.950 --> 15:05.661
become a spineless nobody
with no prospects.

15:07.746 --> 15:10.373
You need to make her
lose all interest.

15:11.625 --> 15:14.711
We'll do it together, okay?

15:15.629 --> 15:17.047
Okay…

15:22.094 --> 15:26.594
What? Koichi Hirose did what?
I don't believe it!

15:27.015 --> 15:30.143
He was really shoplifting?
Disgusting.

15:30.227 --> 15:32.771
Yeah! Koichi said it himself.

15:32.980 --> 15:36.191
To think he was bragging
about it, the jerk!

15:36.650 --> 15:40.487
Even worse, Koichi can't
keep a promise to save his life!

15:40.571 --> 15:43.198
I lent him money,
and the ass never paid me back.

15:43.365 --> 15:47.243
He also cheats on tests
and steals girls' underwear.

15:47.327 --> 15:50.747
The guy's got no future.
He'll end up ruining his own life.

15:50.831 --> 15:52.916
No way am I gonna
hang out with him anymore.

15:53.000 --> 15:54.626
Our friendship is over!

15:59.339 --> 16:03.676
Man, that is one intense chick.

16:04.011 --> 16:07.848
Now if Koichi can just confirm
all the stuff we said tomorrow,

16:08.348 --> 16:10.516
there's no way
she'll still be interested.

16:15.522 --> 16:17.440
Josuke, Okuyasu…

16:18.025 --> 16:20.861
I wonder if all that stuff
they did worked.

16:23.447 --> 16:27.075
I hope she just forgets about me.

16:37.586 --> 16:39.421
<i>What is that?</i>

16:40.380 --> 16:43.591
<i>My eyes are closed..
Must be a dream.</i>

16:44.968 --> 16:46.594
<i>A woman?</i>

16:48.096 --> 16:50.181
<i>I-It's Yukako!</i>

16:52.226 --> 16:53.894
<i>Ah, darn it!</i>

16:53.977 --> 16:56.729
<i>She's even corrupting
my dreams now.</i>

16:56.813 --> 16:59.982
<i>Can't she just give me a rest?!</i>

17:09.910 --> 17:14.410
Koichi, your friends don't
seem to think very highly of you.

17:20.587 --> 17:23.172
Don't worry. I'm here for you.

17:23.549 --> 17:25.300
I'll educate you

17:25.384 --> 17:27.803
and turn you into the epitome of
what it means to be a man.

17:28.345 --> 17:31.848
You have a certain something
other men don't.

17:31.932 --> 17:35.352
And you must live up to that potential.

17:36.270 --> 17:40.649
<i>J- Josuke! It all backfired!</i>

17:52.995 --> 17:55.831
<i>What is this place?</i>

18:08.802 --> 18:10.845
Koichi, are you hungry?

18:11.138 --> 18:13.014
Breakfast is almost ready.

18:13.432 --> 18:15.308
O-Okay…

18:16.018 --> 18:18.520
<i>She's got that hair Stand..</i>

18:19.146 --> 18:22.149
<i>I can't resist.
I've got to find an opening and run.</i>

18:23.483 --> 18:24.650
<i>That's my only hope!</i>

18:25.402 --> 18:28.530
I-I'm curious…

18:28.822 --> 18:29.572
Yes?

18:29.656 --> 18:33.368
Your hair last night…
Wh-What was that?

18:33.785 --> 18:35.036
Were you surprised?

18:35.412 --> 18:38.706
Silly me. I guess the first time
would startle anyone.

18:39.166 --> 18:40.709
It was around February this year,

18:41.335 --> 18:43.712
that someone shot an arrow
into my chest.

18:45.255 --> 18:47.548
Though, I was probably dreaming.

18:48.133 --> 18:52.633
When I woke up, my wound
was gone, and I had my power…

18:53.764 --> 18:55.557
<i>Keicho Nijimura!</i>

18:55.682 --> 18:59.018
D-Do you know anyone else who
has powers like that?

18:59.227 --> 19:00.061
No, I don't.

19:00.312 --> 19:03.231
<i>She doesn't know I'm a Stand user!</i>

19:04.232 --> 19:05.691
Now, sit down.

19:05.984 --> 19:07.527
You are a growing boy.

19:08.028 --> 19:09.487
If you don't eat well,

19:09.821 --> 19:12.740
you'll never become
my outstanding little man.

19:13.116 --> 19:15.660
<i>I-I've gotta play along for now</i>

19:16.203 --> 19:17.412
This looks amazing!

19:17.579 --> 19:18.663
Oh boy!

19:18.830 --> 19:20.957
Not so fast, Koichi!

19:21.750 --> 19:23.960
ENGLISH EXAM ANSWER SHEET
KOICHI HIROSE

19:22.042 --> 19:23.543
You received a 16
on your English test.

19:24.961 --> 19:28.089
There may be more to a man
than his intelligence,

19:28.298 --> 19:29.882
but this is unforgivable.

19:30.717 --> 19:34.011
You're going to study while you eat.

19:34.179 --> 19:34.929
Okay?

19:40.560 --> 19:42.228
Now for some questions.

19:42.479 --> 19:45.273
Select the best answer from
among boxes A, B, and C.

19:45.357 --> 19:47.817
The box you choose
holds your next meal.

19:48.068 --> 19:48.860
W-Wait a sec…

19:48.985 --> 19:49.944
You'll do what I say!

19:50.195 --> 19:51.362
While you're in this house,

19:51.488 --> 19:54.157
life must revolve around
your betterment!

19:54.366 --> 19:55.283
Right?

19:57.577 --> 19:58.494
Now for the question.

19:58.912 --> 20:02.749
Prince is known to use the words
"funky music" in his lyrics.

20:02.833 --> 20:04.000
What is the best
Japanese translation?

20:03.959 --> 20:06.711
JUBILANT MUSIC

20:04.459 --> 20:06.294
A: <i>Nekkyo no ongaku</i>

20:06.628 --> 20:06.733
B: <i>Genshi no ongaku</i>

20:07.003 --> 20:09.630
PRIMORDIAL MUSIC

20:09.089 --> 20:09.652
C: <i>Gensou no ongaku.</i>

20:09.881 --> 20:11.507
ILLUSIONARY MUSIC

20:13.260 --> 20:15.178
<i>I-If I don't answer,
she'll get hysterical…</i>

20:15.554 --> 20:18.306
<i>B-But I have no clue!</i>

20:18.390 --> 20:22.769
<i>I have a hunch it's A,
but it could easily be B or C.</i>

20:23.979 --> 20:26.189
<i>Screw it! I can do this…</i>

20:26.773 --> 20:29.609
My guess is…
B…

20:33.029 --> 20:35.072
You got it!

20:35.198 --> 20:36.449
Hurray!

20:36.616 --> 20:38.701
You won hard-boiled eggs!

20:39.911 --> 20:43.122
I'll peel them for you.
With a pinch of salt, right?

20:44.291 --> 20:46.856
By the way, if you had chosen A,
you would've had to eat this eraser.

20:45.876 --> 20:46.835
JUBILANT MUSIC

20:48.420 --> 20:49.170
Huh?!

20:49.296 --> 20:51.214
Box C would've been soap.

20:51.715 --> 20:53.758
<i>W-What?!</i>

20:53.842 --> 20:57.428
Next on the menu is bacon and eggs.
Good luck!

20:58.138 --> 20:59.055
Your question is…

20:59.890 --> 21:01.892
Which characters express
"contrast" in Japanese?

21:02.559 --> 21:04.290
Would it be <i>taisho</i> A,
<i>taisho</i> B, or <i>taisho</i> C?

21:03.018 --> 21:04.269
TAISHO

21:04.644 --> 21:05.895
TAISHO

21:05.896 --> 21:05.917
Would it be <i>taisho</i> A,
<i>taisho</i> B, or <i>taisho</i> C?

21:06.646 --> 21:07.813
TAISHO

21:07.898 --> 21:09.190
<i>Sh-She's not playing…</i>

21:09.483 --> 21:11.526
<i>If I choose the wrong box,</i>

21:11.651 --> 21:13.861
<i>she'll force me to eat
its contents for sure…</i>

21:14.029 --> 21:15.530
Come now, enough dilly dallying!

21:16.072 --> 21:17.448
Your food will get cold.

21:17.949 --> 21:21.577
U-Um, uh…

21:21.995 --> 21:25.206
<i>What can I do?
Now she's playing hardball…</i>

21:33.131 --> 21:35.716
I-I think it's C…

21:36.718 --> 21:41.139
Koichi, you were watching
my expression just now, weren't you?

21:41.807 --> 21:42.599
Huh?!

21:42.849 --> 21:47.349
So your reputation for being
a sneaking, shoplifting cheat is true!

21:48.355 --> 21:49.397
For your penalty,

21:49.481 --> 21:52.192
you shall consume
the contents of boxes A and B.

21:52.526 --> 21:54.402
A is English vocab corn flakes.

21:54.986 --> 21:57.071
B is asparagus a Ia English dictionary.

21:57.656 --> 22:00.283
You're going to learn with
every bite you take!

22:01.409 --> 22:02.159
Here!

22:02.869 --> 22:05.746
Open that mouth!
I'm gonna feed you.

22:06.623 --> 22:09.626
What's wrong? Eat, damn it!

22:12.128 --> 22:13.087
That's it!

22:13.463 --> 22:15.256
You expect me to sit back
and take this?

22:15.382 --> 22:18.385
Well I can't take it any more!
I'm getting outta here!

22:22.556 --> 22:25.183
Something's pulling me!
It's got my scalp!

22:25.559 --> 22:29.354
Th-There's some kind of
hair moving around in mine!

22:29.604 --> 22:34.104
That's right. I implanted a few hundred
strands of my own hair into your scalp.

22:37.070 --> 22:37.820
Koichi,

22:38.488 --> 22:41.949
you will probably hate me for this.

22:42.826 --> 22:44.285
But by the time you leave this house,

22:44.786 --> 22:48.122
you'll look in the mirror
and see a new man,

22:48.790 --> 22:50.625
and you will most certainly thank me.

22:51.126 --> 22:53.962
You'll realize you need
a woman like me in your life.

22:54.296 --> 22:58.091
You won't be able to live
without Yukako Yamagishi.

23:00.427 --> 23:04.431
Should you care to know,
until you finish your plates,

23:04.806 --> 23:06.891
I will not be distributing
any more food.

23:07.893 --> 23:11.271
This is the vacation home
of a famous CEO.

23:11.605 --> 23:13.440
No one will visit until summer.

23:14.274 --> 23:15.858
<i>S-Summer?!</i>

23:16.192 --> 23:16.859
And even then,

23:16.943 --> 23:20.363
it doesn't matter who may come…

23:21.156 --> 23:22.991
Love is invincible, you know.

23:30.498 --> 23:34.919
H-Help!

23:38.548 --> 23:41.509
EPISODE 9
YUKAKO YAMAGISHI
FALLS IN LOVE, PART 2
